@host = http://localhost:5123

### The newest sessions
GET {{host}}/api/Sessions

### Add a session
POST {{host}}/api/Sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start": "2026-10-20T18:00",
  "end": "2026-10-20T19:30"
}

### The exercises of a session
GET {{host}}/api/Exercises?sessionId=1000

### Statistics of the last 4 weeks
GET {{host}}/api/Stats?weeks=4